      "width": 905,
      "height": 125,
      "fontSize": 21,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "text": "localQc = attnNormQc 的 [begin, begin+count) 行;\nForwardLinear(rt, layer, localQc, indexQB, q);\nXliteOpIndexerPrepare(..., q, ..., begin, count);\n// 与上面同一次 Prepare：完整 K + 局部 Q RoPE",
