      "originalText": "localQc = attnNormQc 的 [begin, begin+count) 行;\nForwardLinear(rt, layer, localQc, indexQB, q);\nXliteOpIndexerPrepare(..., q, ..., begin, count);\n// 与上面同一次 Prepare：完整 K + 局部 Q RoPE",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
