      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1525,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 140,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "text": "3  给候选 token 打分，再选位置\nI(t,s) = Σ_a w(t,a) · ReLU(qᴵ(t,a) · kᴵ_s)\nS_t = TopK_s I(t,s)，候选限定 s ≤ t\n\nS_t 是 token 索引；不是主 MLA 的 attention 权重。",
      "angle": 0,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
