      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3  给候选 token 打分，再选位置\nI(t,s) = Σ_a w(t,a) · ReLU(qᴵ(t,a) · kᴵ_s)\nS_t = TopK_s I(t,s)，候选限定 s ≤ t\n\nS_t 是 token 索引；不是主 MLA 的 attention 权重。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
