      "text": "XliteOpIndexerTopK(\n  rt, q, indexKCache, localKw, ..., localTopk,\n  原 queryStartLoc / lens / cachedLens / blockTables,\n  ..., begin);\n// kernel: 与每个请求的 query 区间取交集",
