    {
      "id": "s3_caption",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2590,
      "width": 1640,
      "height": 60,
      "fontSize": 21,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "text": "Sⱼ 表示第 j 个 packed query 的 K 个 token 索引；上图展示分片形状，实际还需满足长上下文门槛。\n每卡汇集结果大小为 4·P·ceil(N/P)·K 字节；收益取决于节省的计算能否覆盖通信和复制成本。",
      "angle": 0,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 300019,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 600019,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sⱼ 表示第 j 个 packed query 的 K 个 token 索引；上图展示分片形状，实际还需满足长上下文门槛。\n每卡汇集结果大小为 4·P·ceil(N/P)·K 字节；收益取决于节省的计算能否覆盖通信和复制成本。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_guard_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 2040,
      "width": 980,
      "height": 40,
      "fontSize": 25,
      "strokeColor": "#b45309",
      "text": "启用条件与配套改动",
      "angle": 0,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 300020,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 600020,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "启用条件与配套改动",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_guard_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 980,
      "height": 230,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "text": "vLLM-Ascend：xlite_graph_config\n  enabled=true，full_mode=true，enable_dsacp=true\n  dsacp_min_seq_len → indexer_cp_min_seq_len\n\n运行时要求：稀疏长序列路径、TP>1、非 decode，\n最长请求长度 ≥ 门槛（默认 8192），N≥P；\n所有请求 query 长度>1、无 multitask parallel、非 LI-C8。\n另检查 N 与批次 token 数一致、host metadata 完整。",
      "angle": 0,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 300021,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 600021,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vLLM-Ascend：xlite_graph_config\n  enabled=true，full_mode=true，enable_dsacp=true\n  dsacp_min_seq_len → indexer_cp_min_seq_len\n\n运行时要求：稀疏长序列路径、TP>1、非 decode，\n最长请求长度 ≥ 门槛（默认 8192），N≥P；\n所有请求 query 长度>1、无 multitask parallel、非 LI-C8。\n另检查 N 与批次 token 数一致、host metadata 完整。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_support",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 2350,
      "width": 980,
      "height": 180,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "text": "配置默认关闭；TP 组使用一致配置和复制的 metadata，\n确保各 rank 一起进入 CP / 通信。\n\n接口：op / binding / kernel 增加局部 query 范围参数。\n内存：DummyRun 同时估算 CP 与回退路径的内存池。\n状态：PrepareAttn 每轮清空 top-k 复用指针。",
      "angle": 0,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 300022,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 600022,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "配置默认关闭；TP 组使用一致配置和复制的 metadata，\n确保各 rank 一起进入 CP / 通信。\n\n接口：op / binding / kernel 增加局部 query 范围参数。\n内存：DummyRun 同时估算 CP 与回退路径的内存池。\n状态：PrepareAttn 每轮清空 top-k 复用指针。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
